{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big判Y：Y的大块直接交代人物处境、原因和心理变化，尤其S03、S05，单看大字也比较容易明白；X的放大词虽然抓住重点，但部分屏幕读起来更像关键词串。small判X：X的小字提供了较多不同的心理角度和具体体验，Y在S02、S04、S09、S10等屏有小字重复大字意思的情况。core判平：两版都清楚呈现了不愿再忍受委屈与舍不得旧日亲近、归属感之间的反复拉扯，也都在结尾落到带着想念继续生活、不再牺牲尊严。concise判X：Y有几处同屏重复，如S04的委屈刺痛、S09的门与脚步、S10的没有答案，X整体更少重复表达；human判X：Y的“遇见那样的相处”搭配不自然，“那点轻松一退，缠在一起的念头又把他搅得发酸”也比较生硬，S03还连续两次使用“心里”造成重复。fine判X：“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”“刚才是真的相信，还是只在努力相信”等体验具体、有辨识度，不只是泛泛表达难过；load判X：Y在S03、S10、S11等较短停留屏上安排了多块较长的大字，X只突出较短的关键词组，实际扫读负担更轻。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "80a0bd30-c773-4614-b1c3-bafe344e6a8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T045946145606Z", "elapsed_seconds": 179.329, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:02:45.481004+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b460cdb25ff298b67fba417d274b49c0a0e9ab29e1e711fc03b2dd6316bcae2c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code